@@ -14,6 +14,10 @@
 
   For more information see [MDL-87264](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-87264)
 
+- `\core_question\category_manager::move_questions()` and `move_questions_and_delete_category()` now accept an optional array of question ids. If given, only those questions are moved to the new category. `move_questions_and_delete_category()` deletes any remaining questions that are not in use along with the category (questions that are in use are always moved). A new method `get_in_use_question_ids_in_category()` returns the ids of the questions in a category that are in use, and `delete_category()` now deletes any unused questions left in the category, throwing an exception if any are still in use. The category deletion UI now offers the option to delete the questions in the category instead of moving them.
+
+  For more information see [MDL-61427](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-61427)
+
 ### Changed
 
 - The UI for switching question banks is now encapsulated in the `core_question/bank_switcher` Javascript module. This takes an existing modal and replaces the content with the switcher. It will then emit a custom `bankSwitched` event on the modal's DOM element when a new bank is selected.
